:Character Test Routines

     Thå  Characteò Tesô routineó checë thå characteò iî thå 
Á registeò (afteò maskinç ouô itó MSB© tï seå iæ iô meetó  á 
condition.  These conditions are:

ISALNUM     -- Is Alphanumeric Char?
ISALPHA     -- Is Alphabetic Char?
ISCTRL      -- Is Control Char?
ISDIGIT     -- Is Digit Char?
ISGRAPH     -- Is Graphic Char?
